  → Design a constrained fused layout that guarantees multiple guides and many-to-few basin convergence without ambiguous physics
  • Implement solver, generator, and in-code design analysis in target code.py
  • Run repeated generation/solver tests, diagnose failures, and iterate until pass rate >= 80%
  • Measure fusion-specific behavior metrics on generated samples and verify non-degeneracy
